ble_recv
Receive files over BLE on M5Stack Cardputer ADV (MicroHydra).
Companion of ble_send and the Android app Cardputer BLE Blocks.
Install
Copy the `ble_recv` folder to `/apps/` on the device:
```
/apps/ble_recv/__init__.py
/apps/ble_recv/icon.raw
```
Usage
Run ble_recv — device advertises as `Cardputer-ADV`.
Connect from the Android app or from another Cardputer running `ble_send` (mode 2).
When transfer finishes you can edit the filename or accept the suggested one.
Quit with `ESC`, ``` or `G0`.
See the main project README for the full protocol and the Android app.
